<Legal title="Acceptable Use Policy" heading="Acceptable Use Policy" description="What you may not do with swarmnest.ai, its API, its data and products bought in the Swarmnest marketplace." path="/acceptable-use/">
<p>This policy is part of our <a href="/terms/">Terms of Sale and Use</a>. It applies to everyone who uses swarmnest.ai, the API and machine-readable files, the marketplace, and anything you send us. If you break it, we may remove content, block access, cancel licenses or end accounts.</p>

<h2>Do Not Use the Service To</h2>
