<li>Infringe or misappropriate anyone's copyright, trademark, trade secret, privacy or publicity rights.</li>
<li>Commit fraud, phishing, scams or impersonation, or misrepresent who you are or who you work for.</li>
<li>Distribute malware, or products or submissions containing malicious code, hidden data collection, backdoors or embedded credentials.</li>
<li>Harass, threaten, defame or abuse anyone, or promote violence or hatred against people based on protected characteristics.</li>
<li>Create or distribute child sexual abuse material or any content that sexualizes minors. We report such content to the authorities.</li>
<li>Build or run agents, prompts or workflows designed to break other services' terms, get around security or access controls, send spam, run fake reviews or engagement, or collect personal data without a lawful basis.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Protect the Service</h2>
<ul>
<li>Do not probe, scan or test the security of the Service without our written permission. If you find a security issue, please report it to <a href="mailto:hello@swarmnest.ai?subject=Security">hello@swarmnest.ai</a>.</li>
<li>Do not overload the site or API, get around rate limits or blocks, or use many IP addresses or identities to avoid them.</li>
<li>Do not access checkout, paid product files, accounts or any non-public area except as intended, and do not share or publish download links.</li>
