<h2>Reporting</h2>
<p>To report a breach of this policy, email <a href="mailto:hello@swarmnest.ai?subject=Abuse%20report">hello@swarmnest.ai</a> with the URL and details. For copyright, use the process on our <a href="/takedown/">Takedown page</a>.</p>
